postchoice_ilyameeting_3ceedf82	l	Calm down, take a seat.	game/script.rpy	1820	l thinkingopen evilsmile "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d4bd1d52		I flop down onto one of the desks, dangling my legs. Yang patters over to me.	game/script.rpy	1821	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_6104fcd9	e	Hey little friend.	game/script.rpy	1822	e smile "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_06a585bd		I hold out my arm and he climbs up to my shoulder.	game/script.rpy	1823	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_b5959e6b	l	Now don’t keep me waiting after you’ve piqued my interest.	game/script.rpy	1825	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_daf79c13	e	Getting jealous of your own familiars now?	game/script.rpy	1826	e smug "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_cf7e1b95	l	Out with it!	game/script.rpy	1828	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_c7c0cd27	e	That guy from the student council this morning... He saw you.	game/script.rpy	1829	e neutral "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0a0d947b	l	Ah, I did sense some manner of spiritual power coming from him. So that’s what it was.	game/script.rpy	1831	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_bd4614ed	e	It’s not just that. He’s an exorcist. Said he wanted to eliminate you and tried to present it like he was doing me a favour.	game/script.rpy	1832	e determined "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_34398d30		The air around Lucifrid grows still and dark as I continue. I can’t yet tell if it's me or the situation he’s vexed with.	game/script.rpy	1833	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_9eedbab9	l	Oh, he thinks he can toy with my property? Win over my assistant with sweet words?	game/script.rpy	1835	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_b13a936f		Something tells me the fake boyfriend thing is {i}not{/i} going to go over well. Best keep it vague.	game/script.rpy	1836	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0798b082	e	Don’t worry, I got him to back off for now. But he’s definitely keeping an eye out for you, we need to be careful.	game/script.rpy	1837	e neutral "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_8f75fee6		Lucifrid wordlessly clasps two arms around my neck and leans his forehead against mine.	game/script.rpy	1841	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d0845102		I shiver.	game/script.rpy	1842	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_dd68ad45		He doesn’t look angry, but there's none of his usual joking energy.	game/script.rpy	1843	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_bcb85949	l	Don’t forget, our souls are linked.	game/script.rpy	1844	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_a5eb6eba	l	Whether you’d like to or not, you can’t leave my grasp. Even when I’m not holding on.	game/script.rpy	1846	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_853ce13a	e	Hey, calm down. I just said I got him to back off. I defended your honour, spider prince.	game/script.rpy	1847	e conflicted "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0caca11b		He releases me swiftly.	game/script.rpy	1848	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_919965fc	l	Hehe, just making sure you know!	game/script.rpy	1852	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_611a1aea	l	Let’s build an even stronger front against all those who oppose us!	game/script.rpy	1853	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_cf3b90d6		He turns around and strikes a menacing pose.	game/script.rpy	1854	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_c4c0609b	l	We will be the undisputed rulers of this land, either side of the barrier! And there will be no one to stop us, certainly no measly human exorcist.	game/script.rpy	1856	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_e901158b		I laugh along with him—it’s not so bad having big dreams to chase.	game/script.rpy	1857	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_a7a297eb		I wonder why the idea of becoming a great diviner never felt like this. It’s a noble dream in its own right. Perhaps not quite as catchy as ruling the school, but still.	game/script.rpy	1860	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_2d021039		Somehow it’s not fun or light, but heavy and solemn.	game/script.rpy	1861	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_e2321f21		I want to chase a dream that's waving in the wind—one that, if I don't start running, I won't catch. Who knows where it will lead?	game/script.rpy	1862	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_3954b309		It’s nothing like a path set out by my ancestors, trodden by my forebears, carved in the shade of their looming figures.	game/script.rpy	1863	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_971f0cd8		If Mother were here, I would ask her how she felt about it all.	game/script.rpy	1864	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_63d7bf1b		{i}Hey Mother, did it come as naturally as they all make it sound?{/i}	game/script.rpy	1865	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_e7a7fbb0		{i}Hey Mother, did you ever doubt yourself?{/i}	game/script.rpy	1866	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d1ed3c48		Maybe she would've said something to make my path more clear.	game/script.rpy	1867	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_957b83a3		Or maybe just given me another reason for doubt.	game/script.rpy	1868	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_4ada85f3		But she isn't here. And he is.	game/script.rpy	1869	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_1e9b9a62	e	Yes, my liege. Who is the next usurper we shall defeat?	game/script.rpy	1872	e determined "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_dd2794a4	l	I have located one of the greater threats to our rule, they dwell on the dark side of the gymnasium.	game/script.rpy	1873	l guardedhips evilsmile "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_73d26368	e	Leave it to me, I shall speak the binding words.	game/script.rpy	1874	e "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_ea36073d		And so we head off, made invincible in spirit by our continuous successes, the threat of the exorcist but a footnote in our minds.	game/script.rpy	1875	"[what]"
