postchoice_ilyameeting_74d6ee45		Turning around, I flick my finger against Lucifrid’s forehead.	game/script.rpy	2455	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_43960a82	l	Ow! What’s that for?! I’m helping you out of the goodness of my heart.	game/script.rpy	2457	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_99e015b9	e	You’re bullying Emrys for no reason! You know he means well!	game/script.rpy	2458	e evening angry "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0b89c0c7	l	There is a hierarchy to this world and no good comes of disobeying it.	game/script.rpy	2460	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_08466c0f	e	That’s {i}your{/i} world, that you’re {i}choosing{/i} to live in. Not everything is about who’s above or below who.	game/script.rpy	2461	e evening determined "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_5e9aa4e3	l	The only reason you can say that so easily is because you’ve never been at the bottom.	game/script.rpy	2463	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_967eb40d	l	He’d only get hurt if he got involved, better to make it clear from the start. The beyond is no place for weakness or idealism.	game/script.rpy	2464	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_cb9cfe88	e	Even if that’s true, you don’t have to delight in knocking him down a peg!	game/script.rpy	2465	e evening "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_f7b227ff	l	Oh, but I always mix business with pleasure, {i}ehehe~{/i}	game/script.rpy	2467	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d32895d5	e	Is that what this is then?	game/script.rpy	2468	e evening pout "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0836bf9b		I motion between the two of us.	game/script.rpy	2469	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_f4f6fc13	l	Don’t debase yourself, my soulmate.	game/script.rpy	2471	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_e701d2d0		My face grows hot. I don’t know what I was hoping for with that question.	game/script.rpy	2472	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_04135999		I can never tell what’s a game with him and what’s serious. Is everything a game? Is everything sincere? Perhaps both at the same time.	game/script.rpy	2473	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_b05fc4c3	e	Ahem.	game/script.rpy	2474	e evening deepblush "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_5670e0c3	e	If you were aware of our library critter, shouldn’t you have subdued it already?	game/script.rpy	2475	e evening neutral slightblush "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_479e2910	l	All in due time, all in due time. Neither threatening nor meddlesome, it wasn’t exactly at the top of my priorities.	game/script.rpy	2477	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_7a04811b	l	We share an unspoken alliance. Well, {i}shared{/i}, I suppose.	game/script.rpy	2478	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d8e12744	l	It wouldn’t do to refuse my dutiful assistant’s earnest request.	game/script.rpy	2480	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_198d6709	e	But how is it that the other students can interact with it? Has it always had this disguise?	game/script.rpy	2481	e evening neutral none "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_07cd29a6	l	That, I do not know. It must be a recent development.	game/script.rpy	2483	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_78869861	l	It’s not usually a creature of antagonistic nature, so the fact it would attack humans means it’s probably not pleased with the development either.	game/script.rpy	2485	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_7ebd586b	e	Didn’t seem to mind the petting all that much.	game/script.rpy	2486	e evening smile "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_1beb06a7	l	There’s pros and cons to everything.	game/script.rpy	2488	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_fd5db3c0		He reaches out and pets my head in his usual fashion.	game/script.rpy	2489	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_934c81e0	l	See?	game/script.rpy	2491	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_6bba7d5f	e	I’m not a pet.	game/script.rpy	2492	e evening pout slightblush "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_764121d3	l	Alas, I’ve always wanted a pet human.	game/script.rpy	2494	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_b67fcf4a	e	Really? I thought I heard you describe humans as ‘annoying imbeciles’ before.	game/script.rpy	2495	e evening unamused none "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_5339b382	l	Alright, I stand corrected. I want a pet Edelweiss.	game/script.rpy	2497	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_902da858		He grins as I stare pointedly at him. I’m not dignifying that with a response.	game/script.rpy	2498	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d8f53ec4		He takes my hands into his, and I pull back instinctively.	game/script.rpy	2499	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_64f4f45c	e	Stop it already!	game/script.rpy	2500	e evening determined deepblush "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_4eaa62a4	l	Hm? I thought we were going to defeat that cat. We’ll have to travel to the other side for that, do you forget already?	game/script.rpy	2502	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_4e7c10b0	e	O-oh. Right.	game/script.rpy	2503	e evening awkward slightblush "[what]"
