postchoice_ilyameeting_f956900b		The floor beneath me dissolves and my awareness slips. The only thing I can feel is the soft warmth of Lucifrid’s hands—my anchor.	game/script.rpy	2508	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_69066701		I open my eyes a little too soon, and the disorienting sight of the world around me slotting together like puzzle pieces turns my stomach. Lucifrid steadies me when I almost fall over.	game/script.rpy	2513	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0257059e		One day I will get used to crossing the barrier. One day.	game/script.rpy	2514	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_44d9d59d		We find ourselves in a hallway packed with mirrors familiar to me by now.	game/script.rpy	2515	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_83e8001b		It is the nexus of Lucifrid’s domain, each mirror leading to different domains and sections of the dark side of our school.	game/script.rpy	2516	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_02873634		Ever since we suppressed that first icy ghost, he rearranged things to make it connect directly to our hideout.	game/script.rpy	2517	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_91d9a957		I pace the hallway, gazing into each mirror as I pass. They reflect potentialities; alternate futures and pasts of whoever looks into them.	game/script.rpy	2518	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_ed078665		I stop in front of an ornate mirror that shows me asleep in bed, hair grown so long it doesn’t fit the frame, surrounded by towers and towers of books.	game/script.rpy	2519	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_eedaeb4d	e	This must be it, right?	game/script.rpy	2520	e beyond neutral "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_8960524a	l	Excellent work, my dear assistant. This one indeed connects to the library.	game/script.rpy	2522	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_b9373e95		The library...	game/script.rpy	2531	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_9b9636c6		The layout is identical to its light side counterpart but the details are all different, like the same page in a colouring book filled in by different people.	game/script.rpy	2532	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_8373e2dd		Nightgown flowing, a petite girl with catlike features trots over to us, her expression stern. Her ears perk up when she spots Lucifrid.	game/script.rpy	2534	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_ff967f52	"Librarian"	Your Dark Majesty, what brings you to my library today?	game/script.rpy	2535	"Librarian" "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_6f945391		She addresses him respectfully but curtly, giving both of us small nods of acknowledgement.	game/script.rpy	2536	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d11ac7d8		Her eyes linger on me. She doesn’t get many humans in her domain, I’d wager.	game/script.rpy	2537	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_851176e8	l	Librarian, I know you to be reasonable. That’s why I extend the courtesy of parley.	game/script.rpy	2540	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_de116341		Oh, wait. This girl {i}is{/i} the library cat. Should’ve connected those dots.	game/script.rpy	2541	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_1f863dc4	l	You’ve been meddling in the students’ affairs, haven’t you? Why get involved with the light side of the barrier?	game/script.rpy	2543	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_06d962b6	"Librarian"	I—	game/script.rpy	2544	"Librarian" "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0ef80984	l	No, phrasing it as a question is unfair. I {i}will{/i} have you return these students’ voices.	game/script.rpy	2546	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_03f3c178	l	The choice remaining to you is whether that will be of your own volition or by force.	game/script.rpy	2548	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_4b809cbb		So his idea of an alliance is unequivocal submission. I suppose it shouldn’t come as a surprise.	game/script.rpy	2549	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_f0c95137	"Librarian"	With all due respect, Your Majesty, why do you take the humans’ side? Did this girl cast a spell on you?	game/script.rpy	2550	"Librarian" "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_98ffe8a5	"Librarian"	I can only imagine you would have laughed with me over this a little while ago.	game/script.rpy	2551	"Librarian" "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_9f998e3b	"Librarian"	The library is mine to oversee, and ought to be a place of calm and quiet. The students knowingly broke that agreement; their punishment is deserved.	game/script.rpy	2552	"Librarian" "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_e94b934c		His casual grin falling from his face, Lucifrid backs the girl into a corner and spins a web round her feet.	game/script.rpy	2558	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_388c7547	l	I don’t take kindly to your implications. Know your place—your every freedom exists because I allow it.	game/script.rpy	2559	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_0751bed5	l	Every day you draw more attention to me and my designs by playing around on the light side. Is my rule a game to you?	game/script.rpy	2562	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_f98aa57c	l	And that is assuming the best, who says you aren't amassing forces to oppose me—appearing in some beguiling, innocent form to win the students to your cause.	game/script.rpy	2565	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_82d85763		I bite my thumb, eyes darting between the two of them.	game/script.rpy	2566	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_c76dbf9e		This isn't going the way we hoped. Is there nothing I can do to help?	game/script.rpy	2567	"[what]"
