postchoice_ilyameeting_e1a97b3e	i	I’ll take that as a yes.	game/script.rpy	2853	i "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_1d25bfc4		I’m slowly learning that talking to Ilya is like one of those video games where you’re presented with a choice but the question simply repeats until you choose the correct answer.	game/script.rpy	2854	"[what]"
