postchoice_ilyameeting_a5d04093	i	They’ll return home soon but they probably won’t make a complete recovery in time for the cultural festival.	game/script.rpy	2862	i "[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_d855aa19		Johan and Caitlin. I only learned their names after the fact. They’re the students that were injured in the library.	game/script.rpy	2863	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_581d7efe		I cast my eyes downward and fiddle with the hem of my skirt.	game/script.rpy	2864	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyameeting_562ee990	e	I... wish them a speedy recovery.	game/script.rpy	2865	e awkward "[what]"
