postchoice_ilyafallout_fc19cfe5		Lucifrid’s eyes soften when he notices the genuine panic in my voice.	game/script.rpy	3097	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ff476ed2		I lower my voice to a whisper, afraid Ilya may find us.	game/script.rpy	3098	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_3a96d694	e2	I— I messed up...	game/script.rpy	3099	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_a1761401	e2	Of course, you know I messed up... But you don’t know what it led to...	game/script.rpy	3100	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_1b9140d6	e2	I thought I could protect you!	game/script.rpy	3101	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ec801e2f	e2	Ilya, that exorcist... He’s set on eliminating you. I-I couldn’t convince him otherwise.	game/script.rpy	3102	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_f973cd54	e2	It’s all because of me! But— but I can still set it right!	game/script.rpy	3103	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_80d9193c	e2	If I can just stay away from you, then I can keep you safe.	game/script.rpy	3104	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_acb127d8	e2	...It’s the only good I can do now.	game/script.rpy	3105	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ce14771c	l	Edelweiss...	game/script.rpy	3106	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_29a5d49d		Lucifrid takes hold of my chin and lifts my face to make me meet his gaze.	game/script.rpy	3108	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_8ef6fb70		Blood rushes to my head. All I can think about is how unsightly I must seem to him in this moment.	game/script.rpy	3109	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_b37c3541	l	You’re an idiot.	game/script.rpy	3110	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_7fd9dd09	l	How does all of this have any bearing on me?	game/script.rpy	3111	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_deb30a2f	l	I am a deity of the otherworld. You're worried over nothing.	game/script.rpy	3112	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_231c81d7	l	You think I can’t handle something like this?	game/script.rpy	3113	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_141d8ff4		Yes, he’s right. I’m an idiot. I know that. But... I didn’t know what to do.	game/script.rpy	3114	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_80bb5dd9		I never know what to do. And yet I keep moving, and acting, and making things worse.	game/script.rpy	3115	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_47f404f3	e2	It doesn’t matter if you can handle it! Be honest, I’m a burden on you! You’d be better off without me holding you down!	game/script.rpy	3116	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_cc5db44e	l	Are you questioning my judgment, Edie?	game/script.rpy	3117	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_4b04b367	l	I won’t say this twice, so listen closely.	game/script.rpy	3118	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_e41cbaca		He leans his forehead against mine as he continues. My heart feels like it’s beating in my throat.	game/script.rpy	3120	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_27afde01	l	You are not a burden on me. I have need of you. {i}You{/i}, and no one else.	game/script.rpy	3121	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_fca39c8e	l	You are my precious assistant, and I will not tolerate you running off elsewhere, no matter what silly justifications you come up with.	game/script.rpy	3122	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_4aff4413	l	No matter your doubts, from now on you come to me instead of trying to take care of things alone.	game/script.rpy	3123	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_7f500079		Something changes in Lucifrid. He’s normally so quick to respond, so candid, but now, he seems unsure.	game/script.rpy	3131	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ba45640c		I was expecting him to tease me for being an obedient little helper, but he lets the moment linger.	game/script.rpy	3132	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_4d4ba4c1		My eyes trace his form.	game/script.rpy	3133	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_c3461e66		The way his hair falls over his brow; the way it curls at the nape of his neck. The deep vermillion of his eyes.	game/script.rpy	3134	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_b7eaf9ee		Without thinking I cup his face in my hand.	game/script.rpy	3135	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_4adb19cf		He casually forces his touch upon me all the time, but when have I moved to touch him?	game/script.rpy	3136	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_a0cc1329		He still doesn’t move. The slight smile he wears seems almost shy.	game/script.rpy	3137	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_3cc68941		With my own heartbeat no longer filling my ears, the quiet allows me to notice his for the first time.	game/script.rpy	3138	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_eadfc204		He isn’t human—but he lives and breathes and feels.	game/script.rpy	3139	"[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_cd7d457e	e2	I mean it, thank you. When I get like this... it’s almost impossible for me to shake myself out of it.	game/script.rpy	3140	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_35662482	l	It was never quite my intention to become an expert in the stirrings of the human heart, but it seems I hold at least a faint grasp over yours.	game/script.rpy	3142	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_0718b0b1	l	Cheer up now, worrywart.	game/script.rpy	3143	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ce003a43	l	Oh, you wound me.	game/script.rpy	3150	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_aa4b30a0	l	I was being entirely earnest!	game/script.rpy	3151	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_2e86753d	l	I’m busy enough managing all the threats upon our domain without you suffering existential crises.	game/script.rpy	3152	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_e7f760ca	e2	See! Right back to bullying! Your feigned concern is only self-serving in the end.	game/script.rpy	3154	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_a57c6075	l	Though it may serve me well, that doesn’t mean the concern is feigned.	game/script.rpy	3156	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_51f506a1	l	You are free to believe what you will, so long as you obey my command.	game/script.rpy	3157	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_5869d4fc	l	I will show you just how serious I am through actions rather than words.	game/script.rpy	3159	l "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_ee2a8fe7	e2	First bullying, now threats of physical nature... I can hardly remember why I felt the need to protect you.	game/script.rpy	3160	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_ilyafallout_80fd748c	l	Perfect! Then it seems this crisis is resolved.	game/script.rpy	3161	l "[what]"
postchoice_broomcloset_f92eade4		It’s hard to believe the prince of spiders is skilled at easing the pains and fears of teenage girls, but I can’t deny that I’m feeling better.	game/script.rpy	3168	"[what]"
