postchoice_broomcloset_da66bc91	e2	...you don’t actually know what will happen, do you?	game/script.rpy	3175	e2 "[what]"
postchoice_broomcloset_61701c1a	l	Ah, I still remember the day I forced you into this arrangement. You were shaking like a leaf, trying to seem brave.	game/script.rpy	3176	l "[what]"
