endings_e515b8a5	l	You want to know? Are you sure you’re prepared?	game/script.rpy	3989	l "[what]"
endings_066b7ca8	e	Even if I’m not, there’s no way around it.	game/script.rpy	3990	e beyond rueful "[what]"
endings_94231825	e	It’s the two of us, right? We’re causing the boundary to collapse.	game/script.rpy	3991	e beyond awkward "[what]"
