endings_9b79413f	l	There’s nothing stronger than the two of us together, not even the fabric of reality.	game/script.rpy	3995	l "[what]"
endings_12b90eec	e	The closer we get... the weaker the boundary becomes.	game/script.rpy	3996	e beyond conflicted "[what]"
endings_932fa08e	l	Our very souls are intertwined, aren’t they?	game/script.rpy	3998	l "[what]"
endings_6bceca3c		He grips both my hands and entangles our fingers as if to demonstrate. Then he presses himself into me, his face up against mine.	game/script.rpy	3999	"[what]"
