endings_9516b617	e	You’ll keep your promise, right?	game/script.rpy	4001	e beyond rueful "[what]"
endings_df67c1d9	l	I don’t recall making any promises.	game/script.rpy	4003	l "[what]"
endings_9a7fe1b2	e	Neither life nor death will come between us.	game/script.rpy	4004	e beyond conflicted slightblush "[what]"
endings_d3736b6f	l	Hehe... hehehe.	game/script.rpy	4006	l "[what]"
endings_ac952349	l	Never thought you’d hold me to that one.	game/script.rpy	4008	l "[what]"
endings_025b0814		In my head it’s echoing: "I love him," "I love him," "I love him."	game/script.rpy	4009	"[what]"
endings_c47c9a4d		It’s relentless.{w} Unfair.	game/script.rpy	4010	"[what]"
endings_69eb79e9		I can’t say it.	game/script.rpy	4011	"[what]"
endings_7ca8edda		I shouldn’t say it.	game/script.rpy	4012	"[what]"
endings_47e0756b	l	My lovely, dutiful assistant. The only way this world can be restored to normal is by dissolving our contract.	game/script.rpy	4014	l "[what]"
endings_b44b3534	l	Will you forgive me for breaking my promise?	game/script.rpy	4015	l "[what]"
endings_8437d6d8	e	No! Not a chance!	game/script.rpy	4016	e beyond determined "[what]"
endings_c71b7937	e	...There has to be another way.	game/script.rpy	4017	e beyond conflicted "[what]"
endings_ba5d4a35	e	I thought it wasn’t even possible to dissolve!	game/script.rpy	4018	e beyond angry "[what]"
endings_6856ead9	l	Ah, always reading the fine print, my reliable soulmate.	game/script.rpy	4020	l "[what]"
endings_e11f56ca	l	You’re right. The only way it can possibly be dissolved is by severing your connection to the beyond completely.	game/script.rpy	4021	l "[what]"
endings_551d6a70	l	I’ll pull it out at the root. Snap our invisible ties irrevocably.	game/script.rpy	4023	l "[what]"
endings_8607f23b	l	You’ll be a puny, powerless human like the rest of them.	game/script.rpy	4025	l "[what]"
endings_cee2f686	l	Ahahahaha.	game/script.rpy	4026	l "[what]"
endings_1389c494	e	Stop it! Why are you being so cruel?! I don’t—	game/script.rpy	4027	e beyond tearful "[what]"
endings_96688755		I stop and look at him.	game/script.rpy	4029	"[what]"
endings_03bd4073		He’s not laughing, or gloating. His face is unbearably sad.	game/script.rpy	4030	"[what]"
endings_a07cd7ad	e	Lucifrid...	game/script.rpy	4031	e beyond conflicted "[what]"
endings_1f18fed0	l	Edelweiss, I’m—	game/script.rpy	4033	l "[what]"
endings_65f58aa6	i	I’ve finally found you. This can’t go on any longer.	game/script.rpy	4038	i "[what]"
endings_7437b9fa		What? Ilya? How did he get here?	game/script.rpy	4039	"[what]"
