endings_d40b5ced		Wait... his sword?! Since when has he had that?	game/script.rpy	4046	"[what]"
endings_5a1f384b	e	Ilya, please, wait!	game/script.rpy	4047	e beyond conflicted "[what]"
endings_e124db0d		Ilya turns towards me. At least he’s willing to hear me out.	game/script.rpy	4049	"[what]"
