endings_7c805346	e2	Because I love you, Lucifrid.	game/script.rpy	4113	e2 "[what]"
endings_9cfe2ac4	e2	Even once this contract breaks. Even once there’s no way to reach you anymore. We’re still connected.	game/script.rpy	4114	e2 "[what]"
